  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training - Varian National Radiotherapy Program for Uganda Ministry of Health Training, through Varian Medical Systems, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A training grant is supporting the U.S. company Varian Medical Services Incorporated to provide radiotherapy equipment and services to the Uganda Ministry of Health Uganda Cancer Institute, which will enhance the country&apos;s capacity to diagnosis and treat cancer patients. The training program supported by this grant helps to educate Uganda clinicians on the use of linear accelerators and other advanced radiotherapy techniques developed in the United States.</narrative>
  </description>
